    {
      "name": "WebSocket Connection Guide",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Technical Interview WebSocket",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://localhost:3000/technical",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "3000",
              "path": [
                "technical"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**WebSocket Events:**\n\n**Emit (Send):**\n- `start` - Start interview\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"userId\": \"user123\",\n    \"role\": \"Backend Engineer\",\n    \"company\": \"Acme\",\n    \"jobDescription\": \"Node.js expert\",\n    \"experience\": \"5 years\",\n    \"cv\": \"Resume text\"\n  }\n  ```\n\n- `answer` - Submit answer\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"id\": \"record_id\",\n    \"userId\": \"user123\",\n    \"answer\": \"My answer\"\n  }\n  ```\n\n**Listen (Receive):**\n- `question` - Receive new question\n- `feedback` - Receive feedback on answer\n- `finalReport` - Receive final report when interview ends"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Behavioral Interview WebSocket",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://localhost:3000/behavioral",
