            },
            "description": "**Emit:**\n- `start` - `{\"userId\": \"user123\", \"role\": \"Candidate\", \"company\": \"Acme\", \"cv\": \"Resume\"}`\n- `answer` - `{\"id\": \"record_id\", \"userId\": \"user123\", \"answer\": \"My answer\"}`\n\n**Listen:**\n- `question`, `feedback`, `finalReport`"
          }
        },
